    {"之后使用官方全天智记时，额外在本机保存真实谈话音频，请确保已获相关人员同意。可能占用较大空间，不上传、不自动删除，不恢复过去的录音。此操作本身不启动智记。","When you next use All-day Lifelog in the RayNeo app, this also saves real conversation audio on this device. Make sure everyone involved has agreed. It may use substantial storage. Audio is not uploaded. Files are not deleted automatically, and past recordings are not restored. This action does not start Lifelog.",NULL},
    {"交给 Agent：开发、打包、校验、导入","Give to your agent: develop, package, validate, import",NULL},
    {"亮度实验仍暂停","Brightness experiment remains paused",NULL},
    {"人工 SID 实验已开启，请在 30 秒内点发送。接收是否成功看镜片图片及 #1，自动显示 ACK 尚未接入。","Manual SID test enabled; tap Send within 30 seconds. Check the image and #1 on the glasses display to verify receipt; an automatic ACK for image display is not implemented yet.",NULL},
    {"仅 Codex 已接执行器；其他 Agent 可选择但尚未连接。令牌存手机钥匙串。","Only Codex is connected to an executor; other agents can be selected but are not connected. The token is stored in the phone Keychain.",NULL},
    {"仅发送当前图片，不启动 OTA，不上传云端","Sends only the current image; does not start OTA or upload to the cloud.",NULL},
    {"仅在你看见7392后测试：标题、分隔线、图标、横竖排","Test only after seeing 7392: title, divider, icon, horizontal/vertical layout.",NULL},
    {"仅将之后收到的最终识别文字另存于本机扩展目录，重启后仍保持开启，直到你手动关闭。包含真实谈话内容，请确保相关人员同意。不启动麦克风，不自动上传。","Saves only final recognized text received after enabling to the extension's local directory. It remains enabled after restart until you turn it off manually. Contains real conversation content; ensure everyone involved consents. Does not start the microphone and does not upload automatically.",NULL},
    {"仅展示扩展已保存的内容，不冒充历史全量。","Shows only content saved by the extension, not the complete history.",NULL},
    {"仅授权本次 TMG2 试刷","Authorize this TMG2 test flash only",NULL},
    {"仅提交一次官方创建回调；等待官方真实列表和ID，未声明成功","Submitted the RayNeo app creation callback once; waiting for the real list and ID; not declared successful",NULL},
    {"仅新增/卸载本工具拥有的测试卡，不发送全量看板覆盖，不启用刷新订阅或传感器，不改固件。安装回执 ≠ 镜片可见。退出页面不会删除测试卡，可回来手动卸载。","Only adds or removes test cards owned by this tool. Does not send a full Dashboard overwrite, enable refresh subscriptions or sensors, or change firmware. Installation acknowledgement ≠ visible on the glasses display. Leaving this page does not remove the test card; you can return and uninstall it manually.",NULL},
    {"仅本机日志验收？","Local log validation only?",NULL},
    {"仅本机选图与预览；原厂固件和当前 R3 头像固件不支持接收。需要新的 AP 模块和已验证路由。","Local image selection and preview only; stock firmware and the current R3 avatar firmware do not support receiving. Requires a new AP module and a verified route.",NULL},
    {"仅检索已归档资料，不执行写入。","Searches archived materials only; does not write.",NULL},
    {"仅清空本扩展内存中的聊天历史，不删除官方记录。正在进行的自有请求会取消并恢复官方模式。","Clears only chat history in this extension's memory; RayNeo app records are not deleted. Ongoing custom model requests are canceled and RayNeo app mode is restored.",NULL},
    {"仅清除本机保存的地址和 Token，不删除服务器记录或眼镜卡片。","Only the locally saved URL and token are cleared. Server records and glasses cards stay intact.",NULL},
    {"仅用于新 N8 / N8W 测试固件。必须亲眼看到眼镜 Turbo Image RX 页上的 SID；原厂/R3 不支持。输入当前 SID 后 30 秒内点发送。本轮最多一张，SDK 收到文件不代表镜片显示，需人工验收。不会触发 OTA。","For new N8 / N8W test firmware only. You must see the SID on the glasses Turbo Image RX page; stock firmware / R3 are unsupported. Enter the current SID and tap Send within 30 seconds. One image maximum per session. SDK file receipt does not prove the image appeared on the glasses; verify manually. Does not trigger OTA.",NULL},
    {"仅研究日志路径。测试前关闭手机互联网但保留蓝牙，结束其他眼镜任务；不要同时操作官方反馈。已保存且校验通过后，可手动请求新一轮，保留旧归档与隔离记录；不会自动重试。超时或结果未知仍禁止重发。最多保留32轮任务隔离，达到上限由Mac检查。隔离不是全App网络防火墙。","Only the research log path is tested. Before testing, turn off phone internet, keep Bluetooth on, and end other glasses tasks; do not use RayNeo app log feedback at the same time. After saving and validating, you may manually request another run; old archives and isolation records are retained. No automatic retries. Resending is prohibited after a timeout or unknown result. Up to 32 task runs are retained in isolation; at the limit, have them checked on a Mac. Isolation is not an app-wide network firewall.",NULL},
