    {"位置和尺寸按 2 像素网格。图标只允许 16/24/32/48；图片可在画布上双指缩放。图表接受 2–8 个 0–100 数值。","Positions and sizes use a 2-pixel grid. Icons must be 16/24/32/48; pinch to zoom images on the canvas. Charts accept 2–8 values from 0–100.",NULL},
