    {"使用自己的 HTTPS 服务及 phone 角色 Token。读取身份后，将其设备 ID 绑定到当前连接的眼镜；本轮不发送卡片。","Use your own HTTPS service and phone-role token. Read its identity, then bind its device ID to the connected glasses. This attempt sends no cards.",NULL},
