    {"保留TDP1传图测试。先在眼镜进入Turbo Display SID页面，再查询。原生导航请从导航页开启。本包的TNV1升级需另行明确授权，默认锁定。","Keeps the TDP1 image transfer test. First open the Turbo Display SID page on the glasses, then query. Start native navigation from the Navigation page. The TNV1 update in this package requires separate explicit authorization and is locked by default.",NULL},
