    {"只保存开启之后官方全天智记收到的音频，不启动麦克风/智记，不恢复历史未保存音频。仅本机，关闭附加事件正文日志。持续开启会占用存储，用完请关闭；不会自动删除文件。App重开后需重新核对开关。","Saves only audio received by All-day Lifelog in the RayNeo app after you enable this. Does not start the microphone or Lifelog, and cannot restore older unsaved audio. Stored on this device only; extra event-body logging is off. Keeping this on uses storage; turn it off when finished. Files are not deleted automatically. Recheck the setting after reopening the app.",NULL},
    {"只修改 AP 内容，不保证只写 AP；可能无法启动，原厂 ZIP 不保证能救砖。先关闭官方自动更新。确认当前无录音、提词、导航或对话，电量充足。输入 TMG2 后授权，随后在官方页面手动开始安装。","Only AP contents are modified; this does not guarantee that only AP will be written. The device may fail to boot; the factory ZIP does not guarantee recovery from bricking. Turn off automatic updates in the RayNeo app first. Confirm no recording, teleprompter, Navigation, or conversation is active and there is sufficient battery charge. Enter TMG2 to authorize, then manually start installation on the RayNeo app page.",NULL},
