    {"说说你想看什么\n例如：一张专注卡，显示今天读书30分钟，目标60分钟，带书本图标和进度条。","What would you like to see?\nFor example: A focus card showing 30 minutes of reading today, a 60-minute goal, a book icon, and a progress bar.",NULL},
    {"请以实际眼镜状态确认","Confirm based on the actual glasses state",NULL},
    {"请使用 Turbo IO 的 turboio-developer Skill，阅读 https://github.com/Turbo1123/Turbo-IO/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPER_ECOSYSTEM.md 。在我的 Server 连接我授权的 MCP，只读获取我选择的数据，密钥留在 Server。仪表盘使用 TCE1 API 的草稿/发布/手机批准；小应用使用 TAP1 540×180 原生组件、20KiB 解压预算、最多4页，生成 ZIP 并校验/预览。先离线演示，再接真实数据；不要假装联网、自动安装、刷机或执行付款等写操作。交付源码、ZIP、SHA256、测试、部署配置和手机导入步骤。App v1 是数据快照包，自动刷新和按钮后端回流尚未接入。","Use the Turbo IO turboio-developer Skill and read https://github.com/Turbo1123/Turbo-IO/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPER_ECOSYSTEM.md . On my Server, connect to the MCP services I authorize and retrieve only the data I select, read-only; keep keys on the Server. For the Dashboard, use the TCE1 API draft/publish/phone approval flow. For small apps, use TAP1 native components at 540×180, with a 20KiB uncompressed budget and at most 4 pages; generate a ZIP, then validate and preview it. Demonstrate offline first, then connect real data; do not pretend to be online, install automatically, flash firmware, or perform write actions such as payments. Deliver source code, ZIP, SHA256, tests, deployment configuration, and phone import steps. App v1 is a data snapshot package; automatic refresh and button events sent back to the backend are not implemented yet.",NULL},
    {"请先从官方固件页重新检查版本；需要两分钟内的 1.0.4.12 或 1.0.5.5 有效回读。","Recheck the version on the RayNeo app firmware page first. A valid readback of 1.0.4.12 or 1.0.5.5 from within the last two minutes is required.",NULL},
    {"请先从手机播放音乐并开启眼镜显示；同步忙碌时不执行","Start music on your phone and turn on the glasses display first; no action while sync is busy",NULL},
    {"请先停止官方全天智记，等音频落盘后刷新再分享。","Stop All-day Lifelog in the RayNeo app first. Wait for audio files to finish writing, then refresh before sharing.",NULL},
    {"请先关闭上方音频保存开关，让官方写完文件尾，再刷新分享。不会删除原件。","Turn off the audio-saving switch above and let the RayNeo app finish writing the file, then refresh to share. The original will not be deleted.",NULL},
    {"请先在官方眼镜软件版本页关闭自动更新；未读到明确关闭状态，不授予试刷权限。","Turn off automatic updates on the RayNeo app glasses software version page first. Without a clear disabled status, test flashing is not authorized.",NULL},
